      <activity id="e1d0700b-596b-55b7-b262-9d102b2adec8" activityNameId="12995d19-16df-5f8b-9c2f-1aec6be41efa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, municipal waste collection, lorry 21t</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, municipal waste collection, lorry 21t
based on a vehicle lifetime of 540'000 vehicle-kilometers;
UUID: 7ff5004b-3e69-330f-a924-60cb03a87b1f
Diesel fuel consumption, air emissions from fuel combustion for Stop&amp;Go driving, tyre abrasion, brake lining abrasion, road abrasion and re-suspended road dust.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Waste collection and hydraulic compression vehicle. Gross load capactity 8.2 tons. Load factor 50%. Average load 4.1 tons. Emissions extrapolated from data for lorry 16t class (ecoinvent 2000 report No. 14). Adaptations for air emissions to Stop&amp;Go driving from average driving emission factors.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: fuel consumption from specific literature data. Rest extrapolated from lorry 16t class (ecoinvent report No. 14). 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ff5004b-3e69-330f-a924-60cb03a87b1f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
